{"id":"ae2aea0052d422dc","group":"92","path":"92/92-fact-delta0-decidable.md","title":"fact-delta0-decidable — Delta 0 Sentences Decidable","display":"fact-delta0-decidable — Delta_0 Sentences Decidable","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-fact-delta0-decidable","aliases":["92-fact-delta0-decidable"],"display":"fact-delta0-decidable — Delta_0 Sentences Decidable","depends_on":["[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]","[[92-df-bounded-quantifier]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-standard-model]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-arithmetic-truth]]","[[92-df-theory-set]]"],"source":"第 V 章 pp. 66–74（PDF 83–91）；本地七公理 Q 的版本","source_status":"原书内容的本地重构"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-fact-delta0-decidable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-fact-delta0-decidable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-delta0-decidable — Delta_0 Sentences Decidable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7ce1b12990ae9469\" href=\"?note=7ce1b12990ae9469\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy\">92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6ed78135d2cc20c6\" href=\"?note=6ed78135d2cc20c6\" title=\"92-df-bounded-quantifier\">92-df-bounded-quantifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ccb738ae4bbf923c\" href=\"?note=ccb738ae4bbf923c\" title=\"92-df-standard-model\">92-df-standard-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" href=\"?note=482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-truth\">92-df-arithmetic-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 pp. 66–74（PDF 83–91）；本地七公理 Q 的版本"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的本地重构"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\Delta_0^G\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\Delta_0^G\\)</span> (bounded formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7ce1b12990ae9469\" href=\"?note=7ce1b12990ae9469\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy\">92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> (Robinson-arithmetic axiom set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> (closed theorem set of system <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_G\">\\(\\mathfrak N_G\\)</span> (standard model, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"ccb738ae4bbf923c\" href=\"?note=ccb738ae4bbf923c\" title=\"92-df-standard-model\">92-df-standard-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\\)</span> (standard arithmetic truth, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" href=\"?note=482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-truth\">92-df-arithmetic-truth</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}delta0\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Delta_0^G\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\Bigl[(\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\varphi)\n\\land(\\neg\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\neg\\varphi)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}delta0\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Delta_0^G\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\Bigl[(\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\varphi)\n\\land(\\neg\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\neg\\varphi)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>句子：只使用有界量词</li>\n<li>有界量词可实际计算</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x &lt; t\">\\(\\forall x &lt; t\\)</span>：检查满足<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x&lt;t\">\\(x&lt;t\\)</span>的有限多个值（不含上界<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x &lt; t\">\\(\\exists x &lt; t\\)</span>：搜索满足<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x&lt;t\">\\(x&lt;t\\)</span>的有限多个值（不含上界<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span>）</li>\n<li>所有计算都是有限且原始递归的</li>\n<li>可证理论包含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>的算术系统能证明每个真闭<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>句，并反驳每个假闭<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>句；不能把公理集<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>与形式系统三元组<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>直接写成<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq G\">\\(Q\\subseteq G\\)</span></li>\n<li>这是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>完备性的基础</li>\n</ul>\n<p>算术强度核对：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> 表示每条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 公理在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" href=\"?note=0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" title=\"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q\">92-lem-local-pa-proves-q</a>；若继续要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span>，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>通过数码计算与固定数码界的有限展开，对闭有界公式逐结构归纳，得到真句可证及假句可反驳。原书将结果分别用于带原始 ≤ 的 (Q)/(R)；本地 ≤ 是加法缩写，不能据此宣称两套公理逐字相同。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 V 章 pp. 66–74（PDF 83–91）；本地七公理 Q 的版本。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"7ce1b12990ae9469","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-bounded-quantifier","status":"resolved","id":"6ed78135d2cc20c6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-bounded-quantifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-standard-model","status":"resolved","id":"ccb738ae4bbf923c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-standard-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-truth","status":"resolved","id":"482ac6c3f68b4b5b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-set","status":"resolved","id":"975b3aa9a1e08797","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"7ce1b12990ae9469","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi \\in \\Delta_0^G$ (bounded formula, see [[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Q$ (Robinson-arithmetic axiom set, see [[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-set","status":"resolved","id":"975b3aa9a1e08797","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Th}(G)$ (closed theorem set of system $G$, see [[92-df-theory-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-standard-model","status":"resolved","id":"ccb738ae4bbf923c","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak N_G$ (standard model, see [[92-df-standard-model]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-truth","status":"resolved","id":"482ac6c3f68b4b5b","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G$ (standard arithmetic truth, see [[92-df-arithmetic-truth]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q","status":"resolved","id":"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"算术强度核对：$Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)$ 表示每条 $Q$ 公理在 $G$ 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见[[92-lem-local-pa-proves-q]]；若继续要求 $Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)$，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 $G$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi \\in \\Delta_0^G","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak N_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}delta0\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Delta_0^G\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\Bigl[(\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\varphi)\n\\land(\\neg\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow G\\vdash\\neg\\varphi)\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x < t","display":false},{"tex":"x<t","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists x < t","display":false},{"tex":"x<t","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":2576,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-365","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-fact-delta0-decidable]]"}],"outgoing":["7ce1b12990ae9469","6ed78135d2cc20c6","468d35690